<title>FRANCE: AGF, Bic, Valeo to join CAC-40.</title>
<headline>AGF, Bic, Valeo to join CAC-40.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CAC-40 index will be reconstituted to include shares in Assurances Generales de France (AGF), Bic and Valeo as of February 24, the SBF French stock markets association said on Monday.</p>
<p>Eurotunnel SA/Plc, Saint-Louis and Union des Assurances de Paris (UAP) will be dropped from the index, the Scientific Committee of the Societe des Bourses Francaise said in a statement.</p>
